000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. ROLS6002.
000300 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000400 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000500 FILE-CONTROL.
000600     SELECT ORDER-FILE ASSIGN TO ORDERS
000700       ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL.
000800 DATA DIVISION.
000900 FILE SECTION.
001000 FD ORDER-FILE.
001100 01 ORDER-REC-FILE.
001200    05 F-ORD-ID PIC 9(6).
001300    05 F-CUS-ID PIC 9(6).
001400    05 F-PRD-ID PIC 9(6).
001500    05 F-QTY PIC 9(5).
001600    05 F-STATUS PIC X(12).
001700    05 F-AMOUNT PIC 9(7)V99.
001800 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
001900 COPY CPM-ORDER.
002000 COPY CPM-PAR9001.
002100 01 WS-AMOUNT PIC 9(7)V99.
002110 01 P PIC 9(6).
002120 01 Q PIC 9(5).
002130 01 WS-EOF PIC X VALUE SPACE.
002140 01 WS-MAX-ID PIC 9(6) VALUE 0.
002200 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
002300 MAIN.
002400     ACCEPT ORD-CUSTOMER-ID
002500     ACCEPT ORD-PRODUCT-ID
002600     ACCEPT ORD-QUANTITY
002700     PERFORM ASSIGN-NEXT-ID
002800     MOVE ORD-ID TO VAL-ORDER-ID
002900     MOVE ORD-QUANTITY TO VAL-QUANTITY
003000     CALL "ROLS9001" USING VALIDATION-PARAMETERS
003100     IF VAL-RESULT = "Y"
003200        MOVE ORD-PRODUCT-ID TO P
003210        MOVE ORD-QUANTITY TO Q
003220        CALL "ROLS9002" USING P Q WS-AMOUNT
003300        MOVE "OPEN" TO ORD-STATUS
003400        MOVE WS-AMOUNT TO ORD-AMOUNT
003500        MOVE ORD-ID TO F-ORD-ID
003600        MOVE ORD-CUSTOMER-ID TO F-CUS-ID
003700        MOVE ORD-PRODUCT-ID TO F-PRD-ID
003800        MOVE ORD-QUANTITY TO F-QTY
003900        MOVE ORD-STATUS TO F-STATUS
004000        MOVE ORD-AMOUNT TO F-AMOUNT
004100        OPEN EXTEND ORDER-FILE
004200        WRITE ORDER-REC-FILE
004300        CLOSE ORDER-FILE
004400        DISPLAY "OK ORDER CREATED ID " ORD-ID
004500     ELSE
004600        DISPLAY "ERROR " VAL-MESSAGE
004700     END-IF
004800     EXIT PROGRAM.
004900 ASSIGN-NEXT-ID.
005000     MOVE 0 TO WS-MAX-ID
005100     MOVE SPACE TO WS-EOF
005200     OPEN INPUT ORDER-FILE
005300     PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = 'Y'
005400       READ ORDER-FILE
005500         AT END MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF
005600         NOT AT END
005700           IF F-ORD-ID > WS-MAX-ID
005800              MOVE F-ORD-ID TO WS-MAX-ID
005900           END-IF
006000       END-READ
006100     END-PERFORM
006200     CLOSE ORDER-FILE
006300     ADD 1 TO WS-MAX-ID
006400     MOVE WS-MAX-ID TO ORD-ID.
